Package: com.albrhi.ytmusic
Name: Albrhi for YouTube Music
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: No ads in YouTube Music, playback that keeps going in the background, the hidden speed control, seek buttons in place of previous/next, no autoplay radio, casting, an OLED theme and SponsorBlock. WITHOUT PREMIUM: this tweak does not unlock a paid subscription and does not report you as a subscriber -- every feature here works the same on a free account as on a paid one. Hooks carried over from YTMusicUltimate by dayanch96 and YTMEnhanced by py233, both GPLv3; their Premium claim is deliberately not included. SponsorBlock asks sponsor.ajay.app about the track and is off until you switch it on.
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide, com.dvntm.ytmultimate
Replaces: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Tag: role::hacker
